        "id": "ch06.s13.p01",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.01",
            "text": "How can a local model be turned into an automatic evaluator for instruction-following outputs, and why is that useful here?",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.02",
            "text": "Ollama is software, or an application, for efficiently running large language models on a laptop.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1475",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1479",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1496",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1498",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1500"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.03",
            "text": "It lets you run local models such as Llama 3, Phi-3, Mistral, and Gemma 2 on a PC or laptop.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1503",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1505",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1507",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1511",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1513",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1516",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1830",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1834",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1837",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1840"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.04",
            "text": "Ollama is used for inference only, not for pre-training.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1518",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1521",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1522",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1531",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1534",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1536"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.05",
            "text": "It is only a tool for generating text with LLM inference and does not support training or fine-tuning.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1634",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1637",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1639",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1641"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.06",
            "text": "It is also described as a very commonly used LLM inference application.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1623",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1626",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1628",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1631"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.07",
            "text": "The evaluation setup uses an instruction-fine-tuned Llama 3 model with 8 billion parameters, accessed through Ollama.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1540",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1544",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1546",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1550",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1554",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1556"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.08",
            "text": "That model is chosen because it has already been fine-tuned on many instructions and is already trained to follow instructions well.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1559",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1562",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1564",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1566",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1572",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1576",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1579",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1581",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@2076",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@2078",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@2079",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@2082",
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@2084"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.09",
            "text": "The idea is to use one large language model, Llama 3 8B, to evaluate another fine-tuned large language model by comparing the correct output with the model response and assigning a score.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1585",
