              "7m2jV7BOFkA@2249"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p01.10",
            "text": "Because the evaluator model is already trained to follow instructions, it is expected to do a great job on the new instruction of producing an evaluation score.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "7m2jV7BOFkA@1601",
