        "id": "ch06.s13.p03",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p03.01",
            "text": "Using the terminal directly is enough to start the model, but Python code can make repeated evaluation much easier.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch06.s13.p03.02",
            "text": "A function named \"query_model\" can be used from Python to interact with a Llama model through the API instead of repeatedly running \"ollama run llama3\" in the terminal.",
